INSERT INTO product_translations (id, product_id, locale, name, slug, summary, description, usage_areas, meta_title, meta_description, translation_status) VALUES ('3612ece5-bf90-5bf3-926c-c99be43a5487', 'b3d79e63-bde2-58e0-81b0-023994acb43c', 'en', $h$Versa-Matic® Compatible Spare Parts$h$, $h$versa-matic-compatible-spare-parts$h$, $h$Versa-Matic® Compatible Spare Parts$h$, $h$<div> <div><p>At HD Marine, you can find the Versa-compatible spare parts you need for HD Marine air-operated double diaphragm pumps, such as diaphragms, valve seats, valve balls, pistons, gaskets, air valves, O-rings, clamp bands, and repair kits. HD Marine serves its customers by supplying spare parts for many widely used brands compatible with AODD pumps.</p></div><div> </div> </div><div> <div><p>HD Marine brings its customers the most commonly used and preferred pump part materials and products, such as Neoprene, Nitrile, EPDM, <strong>Santopren, Hytrel, N-fit, PTFE</strong>. After sourcing the right, durable spare part for your air-operated double diaphragm pumps, you should also take the necessary care during repair and service to keep the products from being damaged..</p><p>Through HD Marine, you can access durable, high-quality spare parts compatible with Versa products, such as valve balls, valve seats, diaphragms, and valve rings. Each part has its own place and importance in the flawless operation of the pump. <strong>Versa valve balls</strong> and valve seats provide the back-and-forth movement function while fluid is being pumped. The <strong>Versa Matic diaphragm</strong> provides sealing between two points of the pump. With its practical and flexible structure, the <strong>Versa o-ring</strong> is preferred as a ring spare part for different areas.</p><p>For any questions or issues regarding the <strong>Versa Matic balls, Versa Matic Valve Seats</strong>, <strong>Versa Matic dıaphragms</strong> and <strong>Versa Matic Hardware </strong>of your air-operated double diaphragm pump, please get in touch with our expert team at HD Marine spare pump parts. We would be happy to assist you with any issues regarding Versa spare parts and to reach a solution together.</p></div> </div>$h$, NULL, $h$Versa-Matic® Compatible Spare Parts | HD Marine$h$, $h$At HD Marine, you can find the Versa-compatible spare parts you need for HD Marine air-operated double diaphragm pumps, such as diaphragms, valve seats…$h$, 'auto') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO product_translations (id, product_id, locale, name, slug, summary, description, usage_areas, meta_title, meta_description, translation_status) VALUES ('5a919416-5819-5f3e-b1f7-41f08b15eec0', 'eb24593e-f0c9-5d6c-8aa2-a423fb185155', 'en', $h$Yamada® Compatible Spare Parts$h$, $h$yamada-compatible-spare-parts$h$, $h$Yamada® Compatible Spare Parts$h$, $h$<div> <div><p>HD Marine serves to give you reliable access to Yamada spare parts such as valve balls, valve seats, diaphragms, and valve rings. It brings its customers the most commonly used and preferred materials and products, such as Neoprene, Nitrile, PTFE, FKM/ Viton, EPDM, Santopren, Hytrel, and N-fit, according to their application areas. To keep your air-operated double diaphragm pumps running smoothly and at high performance, you must source the right spare part. During maintenance, repair, and service, you should take the necessary care to keep the products from being damaged.</p></div> </div><div> <div><p>The material that should be used in Yamada diaphragm spare parts will vary depending on the industry. HD Marine offers its customers products such as the <strong>Yamada Pumps Diaphragm PTFE</strong> spare part, made of one of the most widely used material types. You should choose PTFE/TFM when pumping aggressive fluids such as aromatic or chlorinated hydrocarbons, acids, ketones, and acetates. You can also choose material types such as <strong>Polyurethane, Santopren, Hytrel, etc</strong>. according to where you will use them. <strong>Yamada-dıaphragms</strong> should be checked regularly for quality operation, and the necessary repairs should be carried out by experts.</p><p>Valve balls should be checked and maintained for the air-operated double diaphragm pump to run properly. While pumping fluid, the valve balls must properly perform their back-and-forth movement function. HD Marine<strong> </strong>supplies Yamada Balls spare parts, each intended for a different application area, to meet its customers' needs. <strong>Yamada Balls FKM, Yamada Balls Nitrile and Yamada Balls PTFE </strong>are the most commonly used materials. You should choose <strong>Yamada Balls FKM</strong> for areas requiring extreme heat, the <strong>Yamada Balls Nitrile</strong> spare part for applications involving petroleum/oil-based fluids, fuel, and gasoline, <strong>Yamada Balls PTFE </strong>when pumping aggressive fluids, and<strong> Yamada Balls </strong>Neoprene for non-aggressive applications.</p><p><strong>Yamada o-ring</strong> spare parts come in a wide range of sizes and materials to suit the application and industry. For example, the <strong>Yamada o-ring PTFE</strong> spare part has very good chemical resistance to aggressive acids, bases, alcohols, and oils. Its resistance to high and low temperatures also makes it one of the most widely preferred o-ring materials.</p><p>For the working system of air-operated double diaphragm pumps to run properly and reliably, every single part must work in harmony with the others. If you want smooth, high-quality, trouble-free operation, you should check the valve seat, ball, diaphragm, hardware, ring, and the pump system in general. In addition, you should replace Yamada spare parts at regular intervals to keep the product's performance from declining. HD Marine serves with a professional team to deliver the Yamada spare parts you need.</p></div> </div>$h$, NULL, $h$Yamada® Compatible Spare Parts | HD Marine$h$, $h$HD Marine serves to give you reliable access to Yamada spare parts such as valve balls, valve seats, diaphragms, and valve rings. It brings its customers…$h$, 'auto') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO product_translations (id, product_id, locale, name, slug, summary, description, usage_areas, meta_title, meta_description, translation_status) VALUES ('85140ef3-5431-5d03-b3c0-6e3ad8bc8ede', '39089535-f187-5347-8fb3-f35edf83f91b', 'en', $h$Pneumatic Grease Pump 10 Kg – 2110$h$, $h$pneumatic-grease-pump-10-kg-2110$h$, $h$Why the 2110 Pneumatic Grease Pump?$h$, $h$<div> <div><p>This air-operated grease pump with a 45:1 pressure ratio offers a 10 kg grease capacity. It is ideal for short-distance, high-pressure lubrication. Four swivel casters let you steer it easily. The pump uses a steel-wire-reinforced hydraulic hose. The piston diameter is Ø62 mm. The follower plate and spring compact the grease inside the reservoir. This feature makes pump feed easier with high-viscosity greases and in cold regions. In addition, the Z swivel joint at the grease gun inlet lets you handle the hose and gun more easily. The operating pressure ranges between a minimum of 6 bar and a maximum of 8 bar. Use filtered and lubricated air to increase the pump's performance and service life. Optional accessories enhance its functionality.</p></div> </div>$h$, NULL, $h$Pneumatic Grease Pump 10 Kg – 2110 | HD Marine$h$, $h$This air-operated grease pump with a 45:1 pressure ratio offers a 10 kg grease capacity. It is ideal for short-distance, high-pressure lubrication. Four…$h$, 'auto') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
